      ms: 9760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1ec6pmh'
    'female|a||Six people or ninety thousand, the coin''s one virtue is the same: it knows nothing about anyone.':
